{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还想回去找回亲近，但不愿只靠希望回去忍让，想先把眼下过稳。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"想念、犹疑、害怕、没底、倔强\",\n      \"missed\": \"“怕独自扛事、没底，却不收回打算”的完整情绪转折需要读完长句。底部关于舞步、祈祷、前进和问题未解的几条小字，以及右侧四阶段提示，一眼不容易抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍有回去找回亲近的念头，但不想再单凭期待回去忍让，正在尝试先稳住自己。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"想念、不甘、害怕、不确定、坚持\",\n      \"missed\": \"长句中先稳住当下、害怕独自承担、仍不撤回打算这几个层次，需要仔细读才能完整理解。底部“害怕还在，脚却已经往前走”“问题未解，停滞松开一点”是重要补充，但字号较小。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还放不下回去找回亲近的可能，但不愿再靠忍让换取希望，决定继续把眼下的日子过好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、害怕、犹豫、坚定、向前\",\n      \"missed\": \"右侧四条经历提示实际上交代了从离开后的空虚、想念受伤到决定先过好日子的过程，但字号小、位置靠边。底部四组小字也要逐句读，才能看出害怕和问题仍在，但停滞正在松动。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主线其实比较清楚：想回去，但不愿只靠希望回去忍让；害怕、没底，却仍决定先把眼下过好。最影响扫读的是第二条大字把好几层意思挤在一条较长的句子里，而底部小字和右侧阶段提示又分别补充人物的变化，导致第一眼容易抓到“想回去”和“不愿忍让”，却不一定同时抓到“害怕但仍往前走”。下半部金色点线动画能提供流动、聚合和前进的感觉，但更像抽象音乐可视化，不能直接呈现人物处境。整体文字之间是连贯的，主要问题是部分连接信息需要二次阅读才能发现。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5a49707e-ebb5-466f-91d4-771f32db4797", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004836565850Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:49:52.406508+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0fa49eebe77b6cacf1048b5a7b8672bf53f6e34ee759b5d2b42bf7e5f0a3f091", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004836565850Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f830f92be1abf30372cf413cf94e6f99347a854b2b375424a9876a5da4b75425"}}}
